{
 "file": "07CSL05D base 0x5000",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:8",
   "ptr": "0x8",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "禁書『クライツェン原住民族の研究』\\f",
   "en": "Forbidden book: 'A Study of the Kreutzen Natives'",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:30",
   "ptr": "0x30",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "　読みますか？",
   "en": "Read it?",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:4b",
   "ptr": "0x4b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  貴族たちの祖先である聖堂騎士団が、\\n",
   "en": "When the Templar Knights, ancestors of the nobles, invaded from across the sea, a strange civilization of the natives was already flourishing in this land.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:74",
   "ptr": "0x74",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  海の彼方より進攻してきた時、すでに、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:4b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:9f",
   "ptr": "0x9f",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  この地には原住民による奇妙な文明が\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:4b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:c8",
   "ptr": "0xc8",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  栄えていた。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:4b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:dc",
   "ptr": "0xdc",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  それは、この地で眠る黒竜を目覚めさ\\n",
   "en": "It was a civilization of sorcery, founded on one unified will: never to wake the Black Dragon sleeping in this land... never to let those who would disturb its sleep draw near.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:105",
   "ptr": "0x105",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  せない・・・眠りを妨げる者を近寄ら\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:12e",
   "ptr": "0x12e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  せない、という統一された意志の元に\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:157",
   "ptr": "0x157",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  成立した呪術的な文明だった。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:dc"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:17b",
   "ptr": "0x17b",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ４つの神殿、２つの聖地、２つの都市\\n",
   "en": "Their nation, made up of four temples, two holy sites and two cities, reveals its sorcerous nature all the more clearly when one looks at how these were placed.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:1a4",
   "ptr": "0x1a4",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  で構成された彼らの国は、その相対的\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:17b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:1cd",
   "ptr": "0x1cd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  な位置関係を見れば、より一層、呪術\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:17b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:1f6",
   "ptr": "0x1f6",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  性が浮き彫りにされて来るだろう。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:17b"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:21e",
   "ptr": "0x21e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ４つの神殿とは、黒竜洞、マッカロッ\\n",
   "en": "The four temples are the ruins of the Black Dragon Cave, Maccaloc, the lake and the valley. The two holy sites are the Nobles' Tower and the Forest Island.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:247",
   "ptr": "0x247",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ク、湖、谷間の各遺跡のことであり、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:21e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:270",
   "ptr": "0x270",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  ２つの聖地とは\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:21e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:285",
   "ptr": "0x285",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  《貴族の塔》と《森の島》、\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ２つの聖地とは\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:21e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:2a7",
   "ptr": "0x2a7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ２つの都市のひとつは、黒竜洞の深く\\n",
   "en": "Of the two cities, one is an unconfirmed buried city said to sleep deep in the Black Dragon Cave; the other is present-day Balkrutha.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:2d0",
   "ptr": "0x2d0",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  に眠るとされる未確認の埋没都市、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:2a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:2f7",
   "ptr": "0x2f7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  もうひとつは、現在のバルクルーサで\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:2a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:320",
   "ptr": "0x320",
   "len": 10,
   "jp": "  ある。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 10,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:2a7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:32e",
   "ptr": "0x32e",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  クライツェンの中心に位置する\\n",
   "en": "From Maccaloc, at the heart of Kreutzen, a line drawn northeast leads to the Black Dragon Cave, and one drawn southwest to Balkrutha.",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:351",
   "ptr": "0x351",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  マッカロックより、北東へ伸ばした\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:32e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:378",
   "ptr": "0x378",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  線上に黒竜洞、南西へ伸ばした線上に\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:32e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:3a1",
   "ptr": "0x3a1",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  バルクルーサ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:32e"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:3b7",
   "ptr": "0x3b7",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  この斜めの直線を中心線として見ると、\\n",
   "en": "Taking this diagonal as an axis, one sees that the Lake Ruins and Valley Ruins mirror the Nobles' Tower and the Forest Island.",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:3e2",
   "ptr": "0x3e2",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  湖、谷間の遺跡と、《貴族の塔》\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:3b7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:407",
   "ptr": "0x407",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  《森の島》はそれぞれ対象の位置\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:3b7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:42c",
   "ptr": "0x42c",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  関係にあることが解る。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:3b7"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:44a",
   "ptr": "0x44a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  このように、重要施設の位置と地相の\\n",
   "en": "Such a method, giving meaning to the placement of key sites in relation to the lie of the land and so invoking magical effects, does not exist in our system of magic.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:473",
   "ptr": "0x473",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  関係において何らかの意味を持たせ、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:44a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:49c",
   "ptr": "0x49c",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  かつ、魔法効果を発動させる手法は\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:44a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:4c3",
   "ptr": "0x4c3",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  我らの魔術体系には存在しない。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:44a"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:4e9",
   "ptr": "0x4e9",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  むしろ、東方の異国で用いられてる\\n",
   "en": "Rather, it is closer to the magic used in the lands of the East.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:510",
   "ptr": "0x510",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  魔術に近い。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:4e9"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:524",
   "ptr": "0x524",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  風水、あるいは奇門遁甲（きもんとん\\n",
   "en": "It is what is called feng shui, or Qimen Dunjia. Which leads one to wonder...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:54d",
   "ptr": "0x54d",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  こう）と呼ばれているものだ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:524"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:570",
   "ptr": "0x570",
   "len": 32,
   "jp": "  そのことから推察すると・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 32,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:524"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:594",
   "ptr": "0x594",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  眠りについた黒竜に、幾重にも封印を\\n",
   "en": "Were those who laid seal upon seal on the sleeping Black Dragon, making the land of Kreutzen itself one vast barrier, people from the lands of the East,",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:5bd",
   "ptr": "0x5bd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  施して、クライツェンの地そのものを\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:594"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:5e6",
   "ptr": "0x5e6",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  巨大な結界と成したのは、東方の異国\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:594"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:60f",
   "ptr": "0x60f",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  の者たちであり、\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:594"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:627",
   "ptr": "0x627",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  その中から結界の監視者として残さ\\n",
   "en": "and did those of them left behind as watchers of the barrier become the people we call the natives?",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:64e",
   "ptr": "0x64e",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  れた人々が、我らの言う原住民と\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:627"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:673",
   "ptr": "0x673",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  なったのではないか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:627"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:68f",
   "ptr": "0x68f",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  言わば、クライツェンの地は黒竜を\\n",
   "en": "So to speak, Kreutzen is a great temple sealing the Black Dragon, and the natives were its priests...",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:6b6",
   "ptr": "0x6b6",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  封じる大神殿であり彼ら原住民は、\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:68f"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:6dd",
   "ptr": "0x6dd",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  その神官だったのだ・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:68f"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:6fd",
   "ptr": "0x6fd",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  そのように整然たる秩序を持った\\n",
   "en": "And in a land of such perfect order, what did our noble ancestors do?",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:722",
   "ptr": "0x722",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  地において、我が貴族の祖先たちは\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:6fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:749",
   "ptr": "0x749",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "  何をやったのか？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:6fd"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:761",
   "ptr": "0x761",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "  武力を以って原住民たちを辺境へ\\n",
   "en": "They drove the natives to the Frontier by force of arms, tore down the holy sites, and rebuilt the cities from their very foundations.",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:786",
   "ptr": "0x786",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  追いやり、聖地を打ち壊し、都市を\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:761"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:7ad",
   "ptr": "0x7ad",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "  根本から造り変えたのだ。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 07CSL05D:761"
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:7cd",
   "ptr": "0x7cd",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  この破壊が結界に与えた影響は大き\\n",
   "en": "This destruction did great harm to the barrier.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "07CSL05D:7f4",
